# Alacrian Armory's combat trigger on a Vehicle: Reckoner Bankbuster, uncrewed, becomes an artifact creature until end of turn
# (CR 205.1b, 301.7, 611.2a) and, being a creature, takes the Armory's +0/+1 and vigilance, so it attacks as a 4/5 and stays untapped.
# The Caustic Bronco that was not chosen is not saddled (the saddling is only "if it's a Mount"); by turn 5 the Bankbuster is
# a plain artifact again.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Mox Sapphire
Reckoner Bankbuster
Caustic Bronco
Plains
Alacrian Armory
Plains x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Plains.Play
